    <h1>Divorce in Illinois:<br>What It Means for Your <span class="brand-italic">Finances</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Illinois uses a formula for spousal maintenance, but it divides property "equitably," which is not the same as equally. Before you make decisions about your home, your support, and your retirement, here is how Illinois actually handles the money, in plain language.</p>
    <p class="updated">Reviewed against Illinois divorce law as of the date noted. General financial guidance, not legal advice.</p>
  </div>
